OL,3,APlug-in solar panels are coming to a
OL,4,Ashop near you - here's what to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlug-in solar panels will be hitting
OL,7,Fthe shelves of DIY shops and High
OL,8,FStreet retailers after the government
OL,9,Fchanged the rules to allow them to be
OL,10,Flegally sold in the UK.
OL,12,FThey are significantly cheaper than
OL,13,Froof panels, can be installed without
OL,14,Fan electrician and are suitable for
OL,15,Fproperties with outdoor space,
OL,16,Fincluding some balconies.
OL,18,FRetailers including Argos will be
OL,19,Fstocking products from Thursday, and
OL,20,Fthe government expects other shops to
OL,21,Ffollow suit.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,110,105,200,300,0,100
