OL,3,APlug-in solar panels are coming to a
OL,4,Ashop near you - here's what to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt hopes plug-in solar panels will help
OL,7,Fhouseholds save money and reduce
OL,8,Freliance on overseas fuel sources, the
OL,9,Fprice of which has fluctuated in recent
OL,10,Fmonths due to the Middle East conflict.
